=H= LUKS

=h= Set up encrypted storage

Wipe the device:
‹sudo dd if=/dev/zero of=/dev/sdX bs=1M status=progress conv=fdatasync
sudo cryptsetup open --type plain -d /dev/urandom /dev/sdX to_be_wiped
sudo dd if=/dev/zero of=/dev/mapper/to_be_wiped status=progress conv=fdatasync
cryptsetup close to_be_wiped›

Format the partition:
‹cryptsetup luksFormat --type luks2 --cipher aes-xts-plain64 --key-size 512 --pbkdf argon2id --iter-time 5000 LUKS_PARTITION
sudo mkfs.ext4 /dev/mapper/cryptlvm2›
